      <div>
        <h2 id="primary">Primary</h2>
        <p>The SAP logo is our single most recognizable brand asset. Its color, anvil shape, and letterforms are fundamental to our visual system and referenced throughout other design elements.</p>
        <p>The gradient blue SAP logo is our primary logo. Use the gradient blue SAP logo whenever possible.</p>
