        <h2 id="chinese-version">Chinese Version</h2>
        <p>This version demonstrates SAP's commitment to Greater China by communicating in the local language and enhancing SAP’s “in China for China approach”. The Simplified Chinese SAP logo is used in the Masthead of the SAP China web site.</p>
