      <div>
        <h2 id="sub-brands">Sub-brands</h2>
        <p>Sub-brands are our big bets — distinctly branded portfolios of offerings that we invest in to attract and retain buyers.</p>
        <p>Sub-brands don’t have unique identities. They differentiate by name, content, and messaging.</p>
        <p>While there are other sub-brand logos, only SAP Concur and SAP Signavio logos will be used within the Masthead of their respective web sites. All other sub-brand content is now housed within SAP.com and therefore the SAP logo is used in the Masthead.</p>
