        <h2 id="events">Events</h2>
        <p>Event-specific logos can be used to visually reinforce branding and recognition for individual initiatives. These logos may appear in the <strong>Masthead</strong> of event pages (such as Label Zone), within <strong>Resource Center</strong> cards, or in an <strong>Event ribbon</strong> to help highlight the context and importance of the event.</p>
