      <div>
        <h2 id="favicon">Favicon</h2>
        <p>The favicon (short for favorite icon) is used for browser tabs, bookmarks, and web shortcuts. We use the solid Blue-7 anvil icon instead of the full logo because it scales better at small sizes, improves accessibility, and strengthens recognition in search and AI-powered search.</p>
        <p>In addition, audiences experience SAP in AI overviews and LLM answers. The favicon is often the only signal telling them where the content came from. The solid blue-7 anvil holds up at every size it's rendered at — legible, accessible, high-contrast — so the source is instantly recognizable. Standardizing our favicon across our properties means every AI citation and search result reinforces the brand.</p>
